  "review_state": "published",
  "type": "FeatureCollection",
  "description": "Scylax mentions a \"Leston\" river on the eastern coast of the Black Sea. It is possibly to be identified with the lower reaches of the modern Tchorokhi/Chorokhi in Georgia, but other ancient testimony gives other names for the upstream portions of this river.",
